The original chat-ui codebase provided the SvelteKit chat foundation. This
fork has been substantially modified — persistence was moved from MongoDB to
Postgres (Drizzle/Neon), and a provenance/honesty layer, open web-search
grounding, a multi-model "second opinion" panel, and other changes were added,
while several upstream subsystems were removed. We are grateful to the Hugging
Face team for releasing chat-ui openly under Apache-2.0.

Apertus is an open-weights model developed by the Swiss AI Initiative
(SwissAI). This project serves it; it did not create it.
